      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The even-power terms and constant are the same at \\(3\\) and \\(-3,\\) while the linear term changes from \\(-3\\) to \\(3.\\) Hence \\(f(3)-f(-3)=6,\\) so \\(f(3)=2+6=8.\\) Thus the correct answer is E.",
